@startuml
' Status: Implemented
' Verified against: src/portfolio_advisor/database/migrations/shortlist_zero_null.py
' Verified against: src/portfolio_advisor/database/migrations/shortlist_parallel.py
' Verified against: src/portfolio_advisor/construction/repository.py
' Verified by: tests/test_shortlist_zero_null_corrections.py
title Shortlist zero-to-NULL correction and replay [Implemented]

actor Operator
participant "Admission command" as CLI
database "portfolio_advisor.sqlite" as DB
participant "Correction validator" as Validator
participant "Shortlist reader" as Reader
participant "Copy-on-write importer" as Importer

box "Operator-authorized write boundary" #FFF2CC
Operator -> CLI: database, new backup path, correction identity,\ndataset fingerprint, original hash, authorization, reason, --apply
CLI -> DB: SQLite backup API to separate path
CLI -> DB: inspect correction identity
alt Existing identity: retry
  CLI -> Validator: validate installed feature and all evidence bindings
  alt Every original admission binding matches
    Validator --> CLI: exact replay; no records added
  else Hash, authorization, reason, dataset, or evidence differs
    Validator --> CLI: reject without mutation
  end
else New identity
  CLI -> CLI: verify live file hash equals authorized pre-write hash
  alt Hash mismatch
    CLI --> Operator: reject before schema/data mutation
  else Hash matches
    CLI -> DB: BEGIN IMMEDIATE
    CLI -> DB: install immutable correction schema and view
    CLI -> Validator: bind raw payload, stable source reference,\nISIN, metric, date, expected original zero
    alt Non-shortlist, nonzero, missing, ambiguous, or changed binding
      Validator -> DB: ROLLBACK
      Validator --> Operator: reject with no partial admission
    else Exact authorized set
      CLI -> DB: append admission and one item per original zero
      Validator -> DB: verify integrity, foreign keys, bindings, effective zeros
      CLI -> DB: COMMIT
      CLI --> Operator: correction count and set fingerprint
    end
  end
end
end box

Reader -> DB: read v_effective_shortlist_metric_observation
DB --> Reader: original zero retained; effective_value = NULL
Reader -> Reader: preserve None as unavailable (no zero coercion)

Importer -> DB: rebuild candidate from workbook evidence
alt Same dataset and stable provenance reproduces every correction
  Importer -> Validator: revalidate correction set
  Validator --> Importer: publish candidate
else Dataset or provenance changed
  Validator --> Importer: fail closed
  Importer -> Importer: delete candidate; keep installed database
end

note over DB
Raw JSON and original metric rows are never updated or deleted.
Future datasets require explicit authorization.
end note
@enduml
